      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just feel like i've failed so hard. everything is so expensive and hard and i look at my kid and i just feel like i'm failing them every single day. i'm just a constant weight on everyone. i feel like a burden to my husband and my kid just deserves so much more than what i can give them. i'm just... not enough.",
