      "content": "Those thoughts of being a burden are a symptom of deep pain, not a truth about your value as a parent. It is exhausting to carry the weight of perceived failure, but please understand that your worth is not measured by your bank account or the comforts you can provide. Your presence, your love, and your effort are what truly shape your child's world, far beyond any material things. If you are feeling overwhelmed, please reach out to a professional who can help carry some of this load with you.",
