      "content": "The thought that your absence would bring them peace is a dangerous illusion fueled by immense pain. The stress you feel is a reflection of your internal struggle, not a defect in you that your children deserve to be free from. They need you, even when you feel inadequate, because you are part of the foundation of their life. Please, hold on and allow someone to help you carry this unbearable weight.",
